Distribution and model boundary
-------------------------------
This repository's own code is the thin official application host plus product
identity, capability expectations and release wiring. It also bundles the model
weights used by the official distribution.

Under the current bundled-model choices, the distributed application is
released under AGPL-3.0. Distribution therefore carries AGPL-3.0 obligations,
including complete corresponding source for the exact build; that source
includes the exact Sailens Android commit pinned at sailens/.

Model files carry their own upstream and training-dataset terms independently
of the platform code licence. The bundled semantic segmentation model is trained
on Cityscapes, whose terms restrict commercial use. See
docs/model-provenance.md for the complete current records.

The current bundle includes YOLO-family model material. Sailens is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Ultralytics. "YOLO" is used only
descriptively in model provenance.

